  "title": "Above Food Ingredients Announces Partnership with BNQ Management to Accelerate Canadian Retail Growth",
  "summary": "Regina, Saskatchewan (December 6, 2021) –– Above Food Ingredients Corp. (Above Food Ingredients ), a first-of-its-kind, vertically integrated, plant-based food company, announced today its latest partnership with BNQ Management (\"BNQ\"), a leading sales broker for the Canadian retail market based in Vancouver, British Columbia. The post Above Food Ingredients Announces Partnership with BNQ Management to Accelerate Canadian Retail Growth appeared first on Above Food Ingredients Inc. .",
